  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.1: Fix package icon (was showing an incorrect/placeholder image). 1.0.0: Initial release. ResilientSecretClient wraps SecretClient in a Polly v8 ResiliencePipeline. Includes KeyVaultTransientErrors helper with pre-built ShouldHandle predicate covering RequestFailedException (429, 503, 504) and transient network errors. Works with any Azure.Security.KeyVault.* client. Supports net6.0, net8.0, and net9.0.",
